=80=99at. These letters on their own have no obvious meaning. There are num=
erous interpretations to the meaning and purpose of these letters. Various =
prominent Islamists such as Az-Zamacheryand and Al-Baaqilaanee claim that t=
heir purpose is to prove the miraculous nature of the Koran. As if to say =
=E2=80=9Cthe Koran is made up of these letters, can anybody imitate one ver=
